sites at mobilix.  Lots of great info.thanks.  Before I start dumping =
and
tweaking the dsdt by removing *'s though, I wonder if someone can shed a
little light on something.

=20

Part of the top line in /proc/acpi/dsdt reads COMPAQEVON800.  I was =
under
the impression that my Presario 1500 series laptop was related to the =
Evo
