family.  Aside from removing the *'s, there are differences in renaming =
the
different id's (C11B etc.) between information in the devel list and on =
some
of the web sites.

=20

Is there a suggested baseline for renaming the id's to names (bat1/2, =
lid,
acad, sleep) or is it kinda just find what works by swapping around?

=20

Thanks in advance.

=20

